  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass at the end of a string is moving in a horizontal circle at constant speed. The string makes an angle θ to the vertical.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the acceleration of the mass?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">g</li><li data-label=\"B\">g sin θ</li><li data-label=\"C\">g cos θ</li><li data-label=\"D\">g tan θ</li></ol>"
